fab (1.1.1+keel2) trixie; urgency=low

  * Apply the units before the common removelists, and let a build select
    which ones it applies through UNITS, so a layer built on a parent does
    not run a component's conf script a second time.
  * Let a unit carry a removelist, applied after its conf script, and name
    the build-time variables its conf script reads in a conf-vars file, so a
    component is the same three phases as a makefile fragment of the shared
    tree.

